@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/cms
@accessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@refreshToken = PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE
@email = user01@example.com
@otp = 123456
@userId = 1
@searchKeyword = admin

### 1) Tạo user mới
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user01",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "Abcde123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Abcde123!",
  "phone": "+84901234567"
}

### 2) Đăng nhập
# Sau khi login thành công, copy accessToken và refreshToken từ response vào biến ở đầu file.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "Abcde123!"
}

### 3) Introspect token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/introspect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{accessToken}}"
}

### 4) Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{accessToken}}"
}

### 5) Refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 6) Xác thực tài khoản bằng OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "otp": "{{otp}}"
}

### 7) Gửi lại OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### 8) Quên mật khẩu
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### 9) Reset mật khẩu
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "otp": "{{otp}}",
  "newPassword": "NewPass123!",
  "confirmNewPassword": "NewPass123!"
}

### 10) Lấy toàn bộ user (phân trang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?pageNo=1&pageSize=10

### 11) Tạo user theo method POST (đã có ở trên)
# Sử dụng request số 1

### 12) Cập nhật user theo id
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "updated_user_01",
  "phone": "+84987654321"
}

### 13) Xóa user theo id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### 14) Tìm user theo id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/id/{{userId}}

### 15) Tìm user theo email
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/email/{{email}}

### 16) Tìm kiếm user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/search?keyword={{searchKeyword}}&page=0&size=10&sortBy=id&sortDirection=ASC

### 17) Đổi mật khẩu (yêu cầu token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Abcde123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPass123!",
  "confirmNewPassword": "NewPass123!"
}

### 18) Ví dụ login với tài khoản đã tồn tại
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}
